            "line": 250,
            "text": "theorem parameterPartial_average (D : RadialDomain) {F : Field}\n    (hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F D.carrier) {p : Point} (hp : p ∈ D.carrier) :\n    parameterPartial (average F) p = average (parameterPartial F) p"
